---

<BaseLayout
  title="D6 Storyteller Prompts | Storyteller & Player Idea Starters"
  description="30 prompts for D6 Storyteller Storytellers and players - turn a raw campaign idea into a fully fleshed world, or take a character concept to the next level with targeted creative questions."
  canonicalUrl="https://d6storyteller.alexmerced.com/prompts/"
>
  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="prompts-heading">
    <div class="container">

      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span class="breadcrumb__separator" aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Prompts</span>
      </nav>

      <p class="section-label">Creative Starters</p>
      <h1 id="prompts-heading">Storyteller & Player Prompts</h1>
      <p class="prompts-intro">
        Prompts are questions designed to turn a raw idea into something you can actually play. Each one has a purpose - a specific thing it surfaces about your world or your character that casual brainstorming tends to skip. Use them in session zero, when you're stuck mid-campaign, or any time you want to go deeper.
      </p>

      <!-- Jump nav -->
      <div class="prompts-jump" role="navigation" aria-label="Jump to section">
        <a href="#storyteller" class="prompts-jump__link">
          <span class="prompts-jump__icon" aria-hidden="true">🗺</span>
          Storyteller Prompts
          <span class="prompts-jump__count">15</span>
        </a>
        <a href="#player" class="prompts-jump__link">
          <span class="prompts-jump__icon" aria-hidden="true">🎭</span>
          Player Prompts
          <span class="prompts-jump__count">15</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- ── STORYTELLER PROMPTS ── -->
      <div class="prompts-section" id="storyteller">
        <div class="prompts-section__header">
          <span class="prompts-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">🗺</span>
          <div>
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:0;">For the Storyteller</p>
            <h2 class="prompts-section__heading">Campaign & World Prompts</h2>
            <p class="prompts-section__lead">
              Use these before session zero to build your world's bones - the wound at its center, the factions fighting over it, the clocks ticking underneath it. Run one or two per prep session rather than all at once.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prompts-grid">
          {storytellerPrompts.map(p => (
            <article class="prompt-card card" id={`prompt-${p.id}`}>
              <div class="prompt-card__num">#{p.id}</div>
              <blockquote class="prompt-card__prompt">"{p.prompt}"</blockquote>
              <div class="prompt-card__divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <div class="prompt-card__purpose-label">Why this prompt works</div>
              <p class="prompt-card__purpose">{p.purpose}</p>
              <div class="prompt-card__tags">
                {p.tags.map(tag => (
                  <span
                    class="prompt-tag"
                    style={`background:${tagColors[tag] ?? 'rgba(201,162,39,0.1)'};color:${tagTextColors[tag] ?? '#806000'};`}
                  >
                    {tag}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── PLAYER PROMPTS ── -->
      <div class="prompts-section" id="player">
        <div class="prompts-section__header">
          <span class="prompts-section__icon" aria-hidden="true">🎭</span>
          <div>
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:0;">For Players</p>
            <h2 class="prompts-section__heading">Character Prompts</h2>
            <p class="prompts-section__lead">
              Use these to fill in what the character sheet can't ask: who your character really is underneath the archetype, what they carry, what they want, and what they're afraid to say out loud. Share your answers with the Storyteller - they'll build the campaign better for having them.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prompts-grid">
          {playerPrompts.map(p => (
            <article class="prompt-card card" id={`prompt-${p.id}`}>
              <div class="prompt-card__num">#{p.id}</div>
              <blockquote class="prompt-card__prompt">"{p.prompt}"</blockquote>
              <div class="prompt-card__divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <div class="prompt-card__purpose-label">Why this prompt works</div>
              <p class="prompt-card__purpose">{p.purpose}</p>
              <div class="prompt-card__tags">
                {p.tags.map(tag => (
                  <span
                    class="prompt-tag"
                    style={`background:${tagColors[tag] ?? 'rgba(201,162,39,0.1)'};color:${tagTextColors[tag] ?? '#806000'};`}
                  >
                    {tag}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Closing CTA -->
      <div class="prompts-closing">
        <p>
          These prompts work best alongside the core rules and the character sheet.
          Get the Core Rulebook for the full system, or grab the free
          <a href="/downloads/">character sheets</a> to record your answers.
        </p>
        <AmazonCTA placement="prompts_bottom" variant="banner" label="Get the D6 Storyteller Series on Amazon" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.prompts-intro {
  max-width: 72ch;
  color: rgba(232, 224, 208, 0.78);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* Jump nav */
.prompts-jump {
  display: flex;
  gap: var(--space-4);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
}
.prompts-jump__link {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(232,224,208,0.65);
  text-decoration: none;
  padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-5);
  border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  background: rgba(201,162,39,0.04);
  transition: all var(--transition-fast);
}
.prompts-jump__link:hover {
  color: var(--gold-300);
  border-color: var(--gold-400);
  background: rgba(201,162,39,0.08);
  text-shadow: none;
}
.prompts-jump__icon { font-size: 1.1rem; }
.prompts-jump__count {
  margin-left: var(--space-1);
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  background: rgba(201,162,39,0.15);
  color: var(--gold-400);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 1px 7px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* Section */
.prompts-section {
  margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  scroll-margin-top: 80px;
}

.prompts-section__header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--space-5);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  padding-bottom: var(--space-6);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,162,39,0.2);
}
.prompts-section__icon {
  font-size: 3rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
  margin-top: var(--space-2);
}
.prompts-section__heading {
  font-size: clamp(var(--text-2xl), 3vw, var(--text-4xl));
  color: var(--gold-300);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  margin-top: var(--space-1);
}
.prompts-section__lead {
  color: rgba(232,224,208,0.68);
  max-width: 72ch;
  line-height: 1.65;
}

/* Grid */
.prompts-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(340px, 1fr));
  gap: var(--space-5);
}

/* Card */
.prompt-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-3);
  padding: var(--space-6);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* Subtle number watermark */
.prompt-card::before {
  content: attr(id);
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -0.5rem;
  right: 0.5rem;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 5rem;
  color: rgba(201,162,39,0.04);
  pointer-events: none;
  line-height: 1;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.prompt-card__num {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  letter-spacing: 0.2em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gold-500);
  opacity: 0.7;
}

.prompt-card__prompt {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: var(--text-lg);
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: var(--gold-200, #f5e4a0);
  font-style: normal;
  margin: 0;
  quotes: none;
  border: none;
  padding: 0;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
}

.prompt-card__divider {
  height: 1px;
  background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(201,162,39,0.3), transparent);
  margin: var(--space-1) 0;
}

.prompt-card__purpose-label {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 0.58rem;
